GLM-5.3 DSpine-Conv Drafter — Attribution and License Notice

This work is a derivative drafter combining the Tencent DSpine architecture
(adjacent causal injection, PCA-whitened unified transfer space, and exact-sender
last-write refinement) with warm-started backbone and causal dynamic depthwise
convolution weights from incoai/GLM-5.3-DFlash2, trained on exlr8-quantized
GLM-5.3 hidden states and on-policy generations.

